			</div>
			<p>If the preview doesn't display on your device, use either link above.</p>
			<!-- Files in public/ are served from the site root; the links also work without a PDF preview. -->
			<iframe src="/resume.pdf" title="Maheet C. Anand's resume"></iframe>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

